// Description: Detects removal of Outlook/Exchange inbox rules after email delivery, indicating potential mailbox tampering or post-compromise cleanup activity
// Data Source: EmailPostDeliveryEvents
// Severity: Medium to High (Email Security / Identity Compromise)
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1114.003, T1078, T1070
// False Positives: User-initiated mailbox cleanup, IT support actions, migration or policy changes

EmailPostDeliveryEvents
| where Action == "Remove-InboxRule" // "Remove-InboxRule" is typically logged when a rule is deleted
| project Timestamp, RecipientEmailAddress, ActionResult
| order by Timestamp desc
